SCOPE — READ THIS FIRST

This licence covers ONLY the independent work in this repository:

    analysis/        the primer, appraisal, catch-up brief and Gerald reading
    experiments/     the two OSF pre-registrations
    docs/            the site and its generator
    ERRATA.md        the verified corrections
    README.md

It does NOT cover the ASS-OS / Regulus specification or Addendum A.

Those documents are the work of Thomas Frumkin (GitHub @teslasolar, Konomi
Systems) and are unpublished. They are deliberately NOT included in this
repository, which is public. All rights in them remain his, and nothing in
this licence grants any right to copy, publish, redistribute or relicense
them. Quotation of his work within the covered material is ordinary
attributed quotation, and is not a licence to the underlying documents.

The site's default build omits the page that would reproduce them, and
deletes any stale copy from an earlier build. The --with-source flag exists
for a private local copy only.

